# Master session scratch (RULING-339) — transient working notes / DRAFT content
# not yet ready for a durable filing, preventively ignored though the directory
# does not exist here yet. Anything cited by another artifact must land the
# same session, per RULING-339 §4 — never left here to be lost.
.master-scratch/

# zeo seat identities (RULING-362) — .zeo/seats.toml names real GitHub
# account identifiers for the Master/Sparring two-account review split.
# This repo has no claude-md/CLAUDE.md (it's a work repo, not a corpus), so
# `zeo seat init`'s own automatic gitignore-ensure step can't confirm this
# file is protected here — pinned explicitly instead. Never commit this.
.zeo/
